P}_{{S}^{⊥}}=a({a}^{T}\\,a)^{-1}{a}^{T},\n$$\n\nwe obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}_{{S}^{⊥}} & =[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]{([\\begin{aligned}-3 & 2 & -2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}])}^{-1}[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 2 & -2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & ={17}^{-1}[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}-3 & 2 & -2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{17}[\\begin{aligned}9 & -6 & 6 \\\\ -6 & 4 & -4 \\\\ 6 & -4 & 4\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nRecall that ${P}_{S}+{P}_{{S}^{⊥}}=I.$ Therefore, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}_{S} & =I-{P}_{{S}^{⊥}} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]-\\frac{1}{17}[\\begin{aligned}9 & -6 & 6 \\\\ -6 & 4 & -4 \\\\ 6 & -4 & 4\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{17}[\\begin{aligned}8 & 6 & -6 \\\\ 6 & 13 & 4 \\\\ -6 & 4 & 13\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, ${p}_{11}+{p}_{23}=8+4=12.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-95365/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0741fad6-3e88-53a4-bb5d-f80e445f8778"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-95365"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-140523/selection/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer/id #uuid "45947fbf-a1c1-52b6-9567-72412ac5c28e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-140523/selection/7f2aea1619f9c4cbe5384e0826442d82ebdb1ac614452244ced54b63c0c77efe" :answer/id #uuid "a99630ae-8219-5450-b1cc-33d547e6c833" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-140523/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer/id #uuid "1ae32e9d-9b67-55bc-ac81-5d58dbf84379" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-140523/selection/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff